Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:08:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Stress tests, simple first: every shock opens on a tap,
 the failing ones too

Each shock that ran the money out was drawn open (its story, three figures and a chart), so a plan
that failed several put 20 figure tiles and charts on the first screen. The hero already lists each
failing shock with the age the money runs out and each row says "Runs out at 84", so the rows now
start shut and the hero says "marked below: tap one to see what happens". The family's worst first
view goes from 920 words, 29 figures and 20 tiles to 267 words and 1 figure;
tests/first-view.known.json lowered. Figures unchanged.

Agent: claude-b
